  "text": "CLAY HOUSE / MEMBER STUDIO\n\nWorkspace settings\n\nMake this space feel like yours. Choose how we keep you in the loop.\n\nYour workspace preferences\nDisplay name\n\nYour name in the studio. Use 1–60 characters.\n\nEnter a display name for your workspace.\n\nEmail me when my kiln firing is ready\n\nOne message when your work is ready to collect.\n\nSave settings\n\nCheck your display name before saving.",
